      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City of New York recognizes that acts of gender-based violence, which may include sexual assault, human trafficking, stalking and domestic violence, are public health issues that impact the safety and well-being of City residents;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
